    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01JH142N95NQWG4VT8C2FT255V\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn about the options available in your campaign calendar, including how to view, filter, and preview your campaigns. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JH142N95FEPHCQYS3CAT9S93\">Campaign calendar views </h2>\n<p>Select a date, choose a time frame, and more for your calendar view from the calendar navigation bar. </p>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32571468756635\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>The campaign calendar displays in the current user’s time zone, which may differ from the account's timezone. </p>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"h_01JH142N95KC50XCJE1ARRD8DW\">View by day</h3>\n<p>From the dropdown at the top of the calendar, choose <strong>Day</strong> to see a schedule of all campaigns on that day. <br>\n</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32571478063259\" alt=\"\" width=\"326\" height=\"202\"></p>\n<p>Use this view to see your day at a glance, make sure any campaigns scheduled for today are ready to go, and get a detailed view of busy sending days.</p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01JH142N9574DM091CYTTW2RVT\">View by week</h3>\n<p>From the dropdown at the top of the calendar, choose <strong>Week</strong> to see a schedule of all campaigns on that week. Quickly see what is sent, scheduled, and in draft mode so you can plan your work for the week. </p>\n<p>Choose whether your week begins on Sunday or Monday by clicking the action button on the far right.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32571478066075\" alt=\"\" width=\"243\" height=\"200\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01JH142N95QKS8RJRMB65V43CV\">View by month</h3>\n<p>From the dropdown on the right side of your calendar, choose <strong>Month</strong> to see a high-level view of campaigns in a particular month. </p>\n<p>If many campaigns are set on a single day, the first few (up to 3) are listed along with text indicating how many additional campaigns are scheduled for that day. Click the <strong>+# Others</strong> button to see all campaigns for that day.<br>\n</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28723523539483\" alt=\"A calendar with many campaigns on one day\" width=\"454\" height=\"155\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01JH142N95M8W34NRXRKMDJPW1\">Choose a date range</h3>\n<p>Click the left and right arrows to navigate forward or backward.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32571468762651\" alt=\"\" width=\"636\" height=\"110\"></p>\n<p>Click on a specific date to view that day (or the week/month that contains that date, depending on the time frame you’ve selected). </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JH142N95BGSX2FJHC7ZJFXTW\">Campaign calendar settings</h2>\n<p>Click the action button (3 dots) to the far right to open the settings menu. Here, you can choose which holiday calendars to include in your campaign calendar and which day your week should start on (e.g., Sunday, Monday). </p>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>All settings applied to your calendar reset when you log out of your Klaviyo account.</p>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"h_01JH142N95Y1FKS9D4GAWHRZZE\">Holiday and event calendars</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Click the action button.</li>\n<li>Choose <strong>Show calendars</strong>.<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32571478071579\" alt=\"\" width=\"362\" height=\"241\">\n</li>\n<li>Choose which holiday calendars to view on your campaign calendar. A wide variety of holiday options are available, including:<br>\n<ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Klaviyo BFCM guide (seasonal)</strong><br>\nStrategies, resources, and recommendations to help you prepare for BFCM</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Country-specific holidays</strong><br>\nFederal and commonly celebrated holidays in various countries and regions</li>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Select up to 5 holiday calendar options (excluding campaigns). You can update your selections at any time.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>If a particular holiday is celebrated in multiple selected regions, it appears multiple times on your calendar. For example, ANZAC day is observed in both Australia and New Zealand. If both of those calendars are selected, ANZAC day will appear twice on April 25.</p>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"h_01JH142N95D9FRSHXE4GHA2T37\">First day of week</h3>\n<p>Choose which day your week should start on (e.g., Sunday, Monday).</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Click the action button.</li>\n<li>Select any day of the week to be the start of the week.<br>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/32571468766235\" alt=\"\" width=\"491\" height=\"216\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JH142N964C1VT5SRMAE0KWDG\">Campaign calendar filters</h2>\n<p>Use filters to limit the campaigns that appear in your calendar view and quickly find campaigns that meet certain criteria. </p>\n<p>You can filter based on: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Audience</strong><br>\nIdentify messages to a certain audience by choosing one or more lists or segments. </li>\n<li>\n<strong><strong>Channels</strong></strong><br>\nFilter by Email, SMS, or Push campaigns.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Status</strong><br>\nDisplay only campaigns that are sent, scheduled, draft/paused, or canceled. </li>\n<li>\n<strong>Tags</strong><br>\nIf you use <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360025834271-Understanding-tags-in-Klaviyo\">tags to organize your campaigns</a>, filter based on the tags you’ve applied. </li>\n<li>\n<strong><strong>A/B test</strong></strong><br>\nFilter by campaigns that have an A/B test.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Archive</strong><br>\nFilter by archived campaigns.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HER4YB16ZGCQTVGAQ87FDE06\">Campaign detail view</h2>\n<p>In the campaign calendar view, click any campaign name to see additional details. All campaign detail views include the following information when it is available: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Campaign name</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>SMS/push: the message body</li>\n<li>Email: the campaign’s subject line </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Status</strong><br>\nIf the campaign is sent, sending, draft/paused, or canceled</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Scheduling details</strong><br>\nWhen a campaign is scheduled to send, or when it was sent </li>\n<li>\n<strong>Content</strong> <br>\nEmail only: the subject, preview text, and sender address.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Audience</strong><br>\nThe included and excluded lists/segments for the send</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Preview</strong><br>\nA preview of a campaign email or the image included with an MMS message </li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HER4YB16PSXGXQ5RVMJSKX43\">Campaign times and dates</h2>\n<p>The time and date when a campaign appears in your calendar is determined as follows: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Sent campaigns</strong><br>\nSent campaigns are shown at the beginning of their send window. For example, if an A/B test began at 9:00 AM on June 10 and ended at 10:00 AM on June 11, the campaign will appear at 9:00 AM on June 10. </li>\n<li>\n<strong>Scheduled campaigns</strong><br>\nScheduled campaigns are shown at the beginning of their send window, like sent campaigns. </li>\n<li>\n<strong>Draft campaigns</strong><br>\nYour draft campaign will appear on the date it was initially created, unless it was previously scheduled and reverted to draft, in which case it will appear on the previously scheduled date and time. To change the date of a scheduled campaign, hover over it in the list view (or click on it in the calendar view), then click <strong>Change date</strong>.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Canceled campaigns</strong><br>\nA canceled campaign is displayed on the date and time it was canceled, not the original scheduled date and time. </li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
